      "id": 1,
      "text": "Franklinton, founded in 1797 by Lucas Sullivant, is the oldest non‑Indigenous settlement in Central Ohio, predating Columbus itself.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
