      ],
      "source": "https://franklintondevelopment.org/franklinton-history"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The neighborhood was named after Benjamin Franklin, honoring the recently deceased inventor when Sullivant laid out 220 lots.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franklinton_(Columbus%2C_Ohio)"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1859, Franklinton was annexed by Columbus, becoming the city’s first incorporated neighborhood.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
