      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franklinton_(Columbus%2C_Ohio)"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The 1943 Manhattan Project connection: B & T Metals in East Franklinton extruded about 50 tons of uranium for the Hanford reactor.",
